### 5.3  Records

The exhibition organizer shall:

- a) maintain documented information to support the operation and control of its processes;
- b) retain documented information to demonstrate that the processes are carried out as per the planned schedule; and
- c) maintain records of the workforce deployed, as per the schedule.

### 5.4  Communication

The exhibition organizer shall establish effective communication systems and channels to disseminate information to exhibitors, visitors, sponsors, service providers, media, and other relevant stakeholders before, during, and after the exhibition, to ensure transparency, accessibility, and effective coordination among all stakeholders involved. The exhibition organizer shall ensure, but not limited to, the following:

- a) Provide complete and updated information
related to the exhibition schedule, venue layout, registration procedures, safety measures, accessibility information, and contact information;

- b) Use multiple communication channels such
as the official website, digital platforms, and printed material to maximize reach and accessibility; and

- c) Disseminate information in multiple languages including Hindi, English and the local language.
