### 5.5 Accessibility and Inclusivity

The exhibition organizer shall ensure that the exhibition venue, facilities, services, and communication materials are accessible and inclusive for all participants, including children, senior citizens, and persons with special needs. The exhibition organizer shall:

- a) provide the barrier free access routes, ramps, elevators, and restrooms within the venue;
- b) ensure that information and signage are clear, visible, and appropriately placed;
- c) facilitate accessible seating areas, registration counters, and emergency evacuation provisions for persons with special needs; and
- d) sensitize staff and service personnel to support participants with special accessibility requirements;

