### 7.5  Exhibition Booth

The exhibition organizer shall ensure that all exhibition booths are designed, constructed, and maintained to facilitate proper functioning, accessibility, safety and effective communication of exhibitor information. The exhibition organizer shall ensure:

- a) compliance of all the booths with the approved layout plan;
- b) that booth dimensions, positioning and spacing adhere to specified guidelines and regulations;
- c) use of structurally stable and safe materials suitable for temporary installations;
- d) clear visibility of exhibitor name’s, logo and stall number; and
- e) booth design and layout provide accessibility and ease of movement for persons with special needs;

