### 8.6  First Aid

The exhibition organizer shall establish a dedicated first aid counter at the exhibition venue, adequately equipped with first aid supplies and staffed by trained personnel. The exhibition organizer shall ensure the following, including but not limited to:

- a) Deployment of trained personnel at the first-aid counter;
- b) Display of contact details for nearby hospitals, ambulances, and emergency medical services at prominent locations;
- c) Arrangements for rapid response to medical emergencies; and
- d) Display of the location of first-aid facilities.
